{"3135260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blueman", "steam_appid": 3135260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>📌Please note</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime: </strong>~<strong>60 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal was to provide a highly concentrated and varied gaming experience designed for a single evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄☃️❄️ Additionally, a New Year level has become available, as we wanted to congratulate our players on the holiday and thank them for their support!<br>Please note that the New Year level is available with English voice-over only.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.poster.avif?t=1776042791\" width=1170 height=367 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.webm?t=1776042791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.avif?t=1776042791\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras_big/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.webp?t=1776042791 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations — you’ve been accepted for a probationary period!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blueman is looking for motivated interns willing to do anything: set up workstations, feed the demon, make others work, and join corporate games without asking too many questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/4246de28eac6df53b4f315b1dbdbba9a.poster.avif?t=1776042791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/4246de28eac6df53b4f315b1dbdbba9a.webm?t=1776042791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During probation you’ll climb floor by floor: on each floor a new “important task” awaits — and for some reason it’s entrusted to you. Clear every trial and, who knows, one day you might be the one giving the orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A do-it-all intern.</strong> You play the person everything gets dumped on, from “little errands” to tasks that somehow decide an entire department’s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No monotonous grind.</strong> Each level plays like a standalone mini-game with its own rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Probation with no room for mistakes.</strong> Mistakes restart the current level, making attention to detail central to the gameplay — just like a real probation where perfection is expected and almost nothing is explained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hell suspiciously similar to work.</strong> Beneath the gloom and demons lurk very familiar office realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short yet substantial.</strong> The compact format lets you experience the whole intern journey — from the first task to the top floor — in a single sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated completion time: </strong>~<strong>60 minutes</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.poster.avif?t=1776042791\" width=1170 height=367 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.webm?t=1776042791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.avif?t=1776042791\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras_big/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.webp?t=1776042791 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations — you’ve been accepted for a probationary period!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blueman is looking for motivated interns willing to do anything: set up workstations, feed the demon, make others work, and join corporate games without asking too many questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/4246de28eac6df53b4f315b1dbdbba9a.poster.avif?t=1776042791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/4246de28eac6df53b4f315b1dbdbba9a.webm?t=1776042791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During probation you’ll climb floor by floor: on each floor a new “important task” awaits — and for some reason it’s entrusted to you. Clear every trial and, who knows, one day you might be the one giving the orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A do-it-all intern.</strong> You play the person everything gets dumped on, from “little errands” to tasks that somehow decide an entire department’s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No monotonous grind.</strong> Each level plays like a standalone mini-game with its own rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Probation with no room for mistakes.</strong> Mistakes restart the current level, making attention to detail central to the gameplay — just like a real probation where perfection is expected and almost nothing is explained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hell suspiciously similar to work.</strong> Beneath the gloom and demons lurk very familiar office realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short yet substantial.</strong> The compact format lets you experience the whole intern journey — from the first task to the top floor — in a single sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated completion time: </strong>~<strong>60 minutes</strong></p>", "short_description": "Blueman — a grim intern simulator set inside a hellish corporation. On each floor, a new mini-game awaits you, reflecting everyday office life.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/45a21653f6326a6e1d4a60b5ee22541910e8f34a/header.jpg?t=1776042791", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/baa732f89939e68b19a90f1d472937b889a884ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776042791", "capsule_imagev5": "https://sh